# Midterm Project Report

## Overview
This project used machine learning to detect malicious network traffic.

## Dataset
The project used a subset of the CICDDoS2019 DrDoS_DNS dataset.

## Models Tested
- Logistic Regression
- Decision Tree
- Random Forest
- K-Nearest Neighbors

## Results
Random Forest performed the best overall and was selected as the final model.

## What I Learned
I learned how to clean a cybersecurity dataset, train multiple classification models, compare performance, and explain model results using accuracy, precision, recall, and F1-score.
